# F2 negative test: homing an extra axis without travel limits.
#
# The B axis has an endstop but no position_min/position_max, so the homing
# sweep cannot be bounded and G28 must reject the request.
DICTIONARY atmega2560.dict
CONFIG extra_axis_homing_nominmax.cfg
SHOULD_FAIL

# Bare G28 also homes the homeable extra axes.
G28
